{
  "realm": "ponto",
  "enabled": true,
  "displayName": "Ponto Municipal",
  "displayNameHtml": "<b>Ponto</b> Municipal",
  "loginWithEmailAllowed": true,
  "registrationAllowed": false,
  "resetPasswordAllowed": true,
  "rememberMe": true,
  "verifyEmail": false,
  "sslRequired": "external",
  "bruteForceProtected": true,
  "permanentLockout": false,
  "maxFailureWaitSeconds": 900,
  "minimumQuickLoginWaitSeconds": 60,
  "waitIncrementSeconds": 60,
  "quickLoginCheckMilliSeconds": 1000,
  "maxDeltaTimeSeconds": 43200,
  "failureFactor": 5,
  "otpPolicyType": "totp",
  "otpPolicyAlgorithm": "HmacSHA1",
  "otpPolicyInitialCounter": 0,
  "otpPolicyDigits": 6,
  "otpPolicyLookAheadWindow": 1,
  "otpPolicyPeriod": 30,
  "otpSupportedApplications": [
    "totpAppFreeOTPName",
    "totpAppGoogleName",
    "totpAppMicrosoftAuthenticatorName"
  ],
  "roles": {
    "realm": [
      { "name": "servidor", "description": "Servidor: registra ponto e acompanha o proprio espelho" },
      { "name": "gestor", "description": "Chefia imediata: aprova justificativas da equipe" },
      { "name": "rh", "description": "Departamento de Pessoal: cadastro, apuracao, fechamento" },
      { "name": "controladoria", "description": "Controle Interno: auditoria e conformidade" },
      { "name": "tenant-admin", "description": "Administrador do ente" },
      { "name": "operador", "description": "Operador SaaS (super admin)" }
    ]
  },
  "clients": [
    {
      "clientId": "ponto-web",
      "name": "Painel Web",
      "description": "SPA React (Vite) do painel web do Ponto Municipal",
      "enabled": true,
      "publicClient": true,
      "standardFlowEnabled": true,
      "implicitFlowEnabled": false,
      "directAccessGrantsEnabled": false,
      "serviceAccountsEnabled": false,
      "rootUrl": "http://localhost:5173",
      "baseUrl": "http://localhost:5173",
      "redirectUris": ["http://localhost:5173/*"],
      "webOrigins": ["http://localhost:5173"],
      "attributes": {
        "pkce.code.challenge.method": "S256",
        "post.logout.redirect.uris": "http://localhost:5173/*"
      },
      "_comment_tenant_id": "OBRIGATORIO para o isolamento multi-tenant: o mapper abaixo injeta o atributo de usuario 'tenant_id' (UUID do ente) como claim no access token. Cada usuario administrativo DEVE ter o atributo tenant_id = UUID do seu ente (definido pelo provisionamento no aprovar da adesao, ou manualmente). Sem esse claim o backend (TenantFilter) NAO resolve o ente e nega o acesso por RLS (fail-closed) — nunca cai no cabecalho X-Tenant-Id. Em Keycloak 24+ com user profile declarativo, declare 'tenant_id' no user profile do realm (ou habilite unmanaged attributes) para poder gravar o atributo.",
      "protocolMappers": [
        {
          "name": "tenant_id",
          "protocol": "openid-connect",
          "protocolMapper": "oidc-usermodel-attribute-mapper",
          "consentRequired": false,
          "config": {
            "user.attribute": "tenant_id",
            "claim.name": "tenant_id",
            "jsonType.label": "String",
            "id.token.claim": "true",
            "access.token.claim": "true",
            "userinfo.token.claim": "true",
            "multivalued": "false",
            "aggregate.attrs": "false"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fullScopeAllowed": true,
      "defaultClientScopes": [
        "web-origins",
        "acr",
        "profile",
        "roles",
        "basic",
        "email"
      ],
      "optionalClientScopes": [
        "address",
        "phone",
        "offline_access",
        "microprofile-jwt"
      ]
    },
    {
      "clientId": "ponto-backend",
      "name": "API Backend",
      "description": "Resource server Spring Boot (valida bearer tokens, nao inicia login)",
      "enabled": true,
      "bearerOnly": true,
      "publicClient": false,
      "standardFlowEnabled": false,
      "directAccessGrantsEnabled": false,
      "serviceAccountsEnabled": false
    }
  ],
  "_comment_required_actions": "CONFIGURE_TOTP habilitado e disponivel para que perfis administrativos sejam obrigados a registrar um app de OTP (TOTP) no primeiro acesso. O fluxo 'browser-mfa' abaixo dispara essa configuracao via o sub-fluxo OTP condicional.",
